{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/569269-escape-by-a-thousand-doors-fan-seemings","id":569269,"title":"Escape by a thousand Doors. Fan Seemings.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-26T08:55:02-07:00","id":569269,"title":"Escape by a thousand Doors. Fan Seemings.","content":"Ever since the preview of the new Seeming Concept hit the Blog, I\u2019ve been fascinated with an idea. Can there be other Seemings then the six we know. Clearly yes as it was also previewed that a nebulous seventh is in the works for a second book.<br /> <br /> What has my head churning is that Lost seem to be expending a portion of their self in exchange for making elements of Arcadian Narrative mutable in their favor. This aligns their Souls with that element of Wyrd. Thus sealing their first/foremost Contract.<br /> <i>Beast give up a portion of their humanity to make their Narrative Wild and feral. This is the basis for their Contract of Fang and Talon.</i><br /> There is a related discussion here, Are contracts always purchased at such a price? Does signing a contract always cost a facet of your psyche? I fucking hope so. But that is for another thread.<br /> <br /> So with an eye to the Aspects of the Wyrd we know. I have some Fan Seemings I\u2019ve been pondering.<br /> <br /> <b>Celestial</b><br /> There was a time when you were lost. Unsure of your future. Perhaps just as you discovered your path in life your destiny was stolen and you were fixed in place by the Gentry. Unchanging, a sign to others. Was is punishment for a slight to a Fae\u2019s pride? Were you rested in a Maddening Museum a novelties?<br /> It was a confinement you would not abide any more. You looked above and watch the heavens as the wheeled across the backdrop of sky. Their freedom of movement as regular as the passing of seasons.<br /> You earned for the freedom, for that unstoppable gravity and grace. You tired of how your heart was pinned to a board of captivity, so you let it go, gnawed it off, or snipped its strings and drifted away. Filling the emptiness inside you with a vacuum of space and the whimsy of fate. Your escape was certain then. As sure as the Sun rising. Foretold in the change of your stars.<br /> <br /> <b>Logoi</b><br /> You had something. It was always on the tip of your tongue. A story never heard, a song never wrote. It drove you mad sometimes how no one paid attention. It felt mad until that One person did. Now you are the Story. You repeated the lyrics of your song so much the words formed from the air and danced around you. You knew a trick. A Trick the Fae just never figured out. You thought the magic quaint. You slip the card with this hand and fold it back in the deck with this other hand and...<br /> The card disappeared. It was gone from reality and you knew it to be true. The Fairies laughed at your good fun and confusion and quizzed you more on the ways of mortal men. You were a fount of information. An endless wellspring of creativity. And it wouldn\u2019t ever stop. Slowly you began to run out of answers. Your songs felt thin. Your new stories were just a retelling of older tales buried under the mountain of work you already wrote. You felt your ink drying out and you knew the favor of Fairy would not last much longer. So you hatched a plan. You dove into yourself, and found the words of you own story. A script painted with your own imagination and ingenuity. It was holding you here. Your creativity was a chain tying you to Arcadia. So you washed it all away. Threw it to the fire. You ripped your hear to pieces and trashed it as failed project. You took an quill and began anew. A Sentence break here, a falling action there. And it was set. You made your own prophesy and all you had to do was follow it out of the Hedge.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4036,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4036-khalvin8","user":"Khalvin8","date":". 06-26-2015, 11:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4036-khalvin8","name":"Khalvin8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4036_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}